Description: The package denoises demultiplexed Illumina miseq fastq files from 16S amplicon sequencing, 
and allocates taxa to amplicon sequence variants using the SILVA 138.1 database.
IQI prediction is then performed against 30 random forest algorithms trained on an extensive dataset.
Model training and package description can be found here: ***URL TO eDNA2IQI PAPER***.

